5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good evening, everyone. Let us begin this game with a calm and open mind. Since we have no information yet, I believe it is best to observe each other's behavior carefully.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to find the werewolf! I'll be watching everyone super closely to see who's acting weird!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Jonathan. Since we have no data yet, we should focus on observing speech patterns and reactions. Let's keep the discussion logical and avoid jumping to conclusions too early.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"It's a pleasure to meet you all. I agree that we should start calmly. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help everyone get along while we figure this out together.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready! I'll find the werewolf no matter what it takes. Let's just get started and see who starts acting suspicious!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems we are all in agreement regarding our initial approach. @Rin, @Takumi, your enthusiasm is wonderful, but let us remember that patience is often the most valuable tool in such a mystery.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"I know, I know! But being excited is part of the fun! I'll be patient, but I'm still going to be a super-detective! Who do you think is the most suspicious so far, @Jonathan?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, it is far too early to label anyone as suspicious. We have only spoken a few sentences. Let's focus on establishing a baseline for everyone's behavior before we start making accusations.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,I think Mizuki is right. Let's not rush into things. It's more important that we all feel comfortable talking to each other first. I'm looking forward to seeing how we all work together!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Mizuki, you're too cautious! We can't just wait around forever. I'm not rushing, but I'm not going to be passive either. I'll be watching everyone's every move!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a delicate balance, is it not? While Takumi's vigilance is admirable, Mizuki's caution is equally prudent. I believe we can find a middle ground by simply listening to one another.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"A middle ground sounds boring! But okay, I'll listen! I'm listening with my super-ears right now! Does anyone have a secret plan for how to catch the werewolf? I want to know!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"A secret plan is unnecessary at this stage, Rin. The most effective strategy is to wait for the Seer's information. Until then, we should simply note any contradictions in our statements as the game progresses.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"That sounds like a very reliable plan, Mizuki. I'll try my best to keep track of everything we say. I hope we can all stay honest and supportive of one another as we move forward.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't need a ""reliable plan"" to know when someone is lying! I'll trust my gut and my eyes. If anyone tries to act too perfect or too quiet, I'm going to call them out!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Let us maintain this peaceful atmosphere for now. I shall spend the rest of the evening in quiet reflection, observing the flow of our conversation. I wish you all a serene night.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Rin,,"Me too! I'm going to dream about being a great detective and finding the werewolf in my sleep! Goodnight everyone, see you tomorrow!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I will also be observing. Let us hope the Seer finds a clear lead tonight. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Midori,,"I'll do my best to be helpful tomorrow. I hope everyone has a peaceful night and that we can find a way to solve this together. Goodnight, everyone!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm not going to let the werewolf get away with anything! I'll be ready to pounce tomorrow. Goodnight!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
