36,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. As we begin our first day of voting, I believe it is time for me to share the information I have gathered.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Wait, @Jonathan! You have information already? Are you the Seer? Tell us, tell us! Did you find the werewolf in your dreams or something? I'm so curious!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, please be clear. If you are claiming to be the Seer, please provide your result immediately. A direct claim this early is a bold move, so we need the facts to analyze.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm a bit surprised to see a claim so soon, but I'll listen. @Jonathan, if you are the Seer, please tell us what you found. We should all listen carefully to what he has to say.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Yeah, hurry up and tell us, @Jonathan! If you're the Seer, don't keep us waiting. Who's the werewolf? I'm ready to help take them down right now!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I am indeed the Seer. I divined Mizuki last night, and the result was that she is human. While I cannot identify the werewolf yet, we can at least trust that Mizuki is not the enemy.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Wow! Mizuki is a good person! That's great news! But @Jonathan, why did you pick Mizuki? Did she look suspicious to you, or did you just have a feeling? I want to know your secret!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, thank you for the confirmation. While I appreciate being cleared, I am more interested in your reasoning. Why did you choose to divine me specifically on the first night? Your logic for that choice will tell us a lot.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Midori,,"It's a relief to know that Mizuki is human. @Jonathan, I think it was very kind of you to share that information so quickly to help us feel more secure. I'm curious about your reasoning too, though.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, why'd you pick Mizuki? If you're the Seer, you should be picking people who look suspicious, not just anyone! Was she acting weird to you, or are you just guessing? Tell us the truth!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I chose Mizuki because her approach was the most logical and structured. In a game of deception, establishing a trusted anchor of reason is often more valuable than chasing a vague suspicion. I felt her clarity would benefit the village.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Rin,,"That's a really smart way to think! It's like picking the smartest person in class to help with a project! But @Jonathan, since Mizuki is a good person, who are you going to check tonight? I bet you can find the werewolf next!","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, your reasoning is sound, and I appreciate the trust. However, @Rin, we should not pressure the Seer to reveal their next target. Doing so would only tip off the werewolf and the Possessed. We must protect the Seer's strategy.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Midori,,I agree with Mizuki. We should let Jonathan decide his next move in private so the werewolf doesn't know who is being watched. It's better to keep the mystery alive for a little while longer to catch them off guard.,"{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about ""protecting strategies""! If we're just sitting around and being polite, the werewolf is just going to keep hiding. @Jonathan, if you're really the Seer, you better find the werewolf tonight or we're just wasting time!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I understand your urgency, Takumi, but haste can lead to errors. For today, since we have a confirmed human in Mizuki, I suggest we observe who among us is most eager to push for a hasty execution. I shall pass my vote.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Wait, @Jonathan is passing? But we have to vote! I don't want to pick the wrong person, but I don't want the werewolf to win either! Hmm, @Takumi is being really loud... is that a werewolf thing or just a Takumi thing? I'll vote for Takumi!","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, please don't let emotion or volume dictate your vote. While Takumi is aggressive, that is consistent with his behavior since Day 0. Without a werewolf result, voting based on personality is a gamble. I will also pass my vote.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I feel a bit conflicted. I don't want to cause any trouble, and Takumi is just being his usual energetic self. Since we have no clear evidence, I think it's safest to follow Mizuki's lead. I'll pass my vote too.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, what are you talking about?! Just because I'm loud doesn't mean I'm the werewolf! That's the dumbest reason ever! I'm the one actually trying to find the bad guy while you're all just chatting! I'm not voting for anyone!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
