69,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a tragedy that Rin was executed, and I am deeply saddened to learn that Mizuki was attacked during the night. The loss of two companions in such short order is a heavy burden for our village.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Midori,,"It's truly heartbreaking. I can't believe we lost Rin, and now Mizuki too... it's so sudden. I feel so sorry for everyone. We have to stay strong and support each other to get through this.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"This is terrible! Mizuki was the only one we actually knew was human, and the werewolf took her out! That's just cowardly! We can't let this happen again—we have to find the werewolf right now!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I have a heavy heart, but I must be direct for the sake of our survival. I divined Takumi last night, and the result was clear: Takumi is the werewolf. We must act now to protect Midori and ourselves.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Midori,,"Oh my goodness... Takumi? I'm in complete shock. I really wanted to believe we were all friends, but if Jonathan is the Seer, then this is the truth. I'm so sorry, Takumi, but we have to trust the divination.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"What?! That's a total lie! @Jonathan, you're the werewolf! You're just using a fake Seer claim to get rid of me because I've been calling you out! I'm a villager! Don't listen to him, @Midori! He's trying to trick us!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a sorrowful necessity to speak this truth, but my divination does not lie. Takumi, your aggression was a mask for your nature. Midori, please remain calm; the path to peace is now clear if we act with resolve.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm so torn... I really don't like the idea of hurting someone who might be innocent, but Jonathan has been so consistent and calm. @Takumi, please, if you're innocent, is there any way you can prove it? I just want us to be sure.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"Prove it? How can I prove I'm a villager when I don't have any special powers?! That's the point! @Jonathan is the one with the ""power,"" and he's using it to frame me! @Midori, think! He's just trying to sound calm to fool you!","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"The truth is often quiet, while deception is often loud. Takumi, your desperation only confirms the result of my divination. Midori, for the safety of the village, we must trust the Seer's vision. Let us end this now.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I've listened to both of you, and my heart is heavy. But Jonathan has been so steady and honest from the start, and he already saved Mizuki for us. I have to trust the Seer. I'm so sorry, Takumi. I'll vote for you.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"This is a setup! @Midori, don't be so naive! He's just playing you with that ""steady"" act! If you vote for me, you're letting the real werewolf win! I'm not giving up—Jonathan is the liar! I'm voting for him!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
